Synthesis:
As of August 29, 2026, Tokyo is experiencing unstable, rainy weather. Current temperatures are reported between 68°F (20°C) and 73°F (23°C) [1][2][3]. The city is seeing high humidity levels, often exceeding 90%, with persistent showers and light rain throughout the day [1][3][4]. Atmospheric conditions remain highly unstable across the Kanto region, with authorities cautioning residents about the risk of localized flooding due to rain [4]. Expected highs for the day are around 77°F, and conditions are forecast to remain cloudy with continued precipitation into the evening [1][5][3].

